        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Trigonometry Exercises</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #d1d1cd;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 18px 54px 16px 62px;\n      background: #d1d1cd;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .problem {\n      position: relative;\n      margin-bottom: 11px;\n    }\n    .problem .stem {\n      min-height: 27px;\n      padding-left: 15px;\n      text-indent: -15px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .choice-mark {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 5px;\n      top: 15px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: 5px;\n    }\n    .choices {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      padding-left: 5px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .choice {\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 7px 0 13px 10px;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .lower .problem {\n      margin-bottom: 11px;\n    }\n    .lower .stem {\n      min-height: 20px;\n    }\n    .lower .choice-mark {\n      top: 4px;\n    }\n    .lower .choices {\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      padding-left: 4px;\n    }\n    mjx-container {\n      margin: 0 !important;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"problem\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">14．已知$\\theta$的始边为$x$轴非负半轴，终边经过点$P(1,2)$，则$\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}$的值为</div>\n      <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n      <div class=\"choices\">\n        <div class=\"choice\">A．$-\\dfrac{1}{3}$</div>\n        <div class=\"choice\">B．$\\dfrac{1}{3}$</div>\n        <div class=\"choice\">C．$-\\dfrac{2}{3}$</div>\n        <div class=\"choice\">D．$\\dfrac{2}{3}$</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"problem\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">15．设$\\tan\\alpha=3$，则$\\dfrac{\\sin(\\alpha-\\pi)+\\cos(\\pi-\\alpha)}{\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-\\alpha\\right)+\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha\\right)}=$</div>\n      <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n      <div class=\"choices\">\n        <div class=\"choice\">A．$\\dfrac{10}{3}$</div>\n        <div class=\"choice\">B．$\\dfrac{5}{3}$</div>\n        <div class=\"choice\">C．$3$</div>\n        <div class=\"choice\">D．$2$</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">拔高题组</div>\n\n    <div class=\"lower\">\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">1．$\\tan105^\\circ=$</div>\n        <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$2-\\sqrt{3}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$-2-\\sqrt{3}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$\\sqrt{3}-2$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$-\\sqrt{3}$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">2．$\\cos15^\\circ\\cos75^\\circ=$</div>\n        <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$\\dfrac{1}{2}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$\\dfrac{1}{4}$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">3．已知$\\sin\\alpha+\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{1}{5}$，则$\\sin2\\alpha$的值是</div>\n        <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$-\\dfrac{24}{25}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$-\\dfrac{7}{25}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$\\dfrac{7}{25}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$\\dfrac{24}{25}$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">4．已知$\\sin\\alpha-\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{4}{3}$，则$\\sin2\\alpha=$</div>\n        <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$-\\dfrac{7}{16}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$-\\dfrac{7}{9}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$\\dfrac{7}{16}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$\\dfrac{7}{9}$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">5．已知角$\\alpha$的顶点与原点重合，始边与$x$轴的非负半轴重合，点<br>$P(-1,3)$在角$\\alpha$的终边上，则$\\dfrac{\\sin\\alpha-\\cos\\alpha}{2\\sin\\alpha-3\\cos\\alpha}=$</div>\n        <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$-\\dfrac{3}{4}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$\\dfrac{3}{4}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$-\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">6．已知角$\\alpha$的终边过点$P(1,2)$，则$\\dfrac{2\\sin\\alpha+\\cos\\alpha}{2\\sin\\alpha-3\\cos\\alpha}=$</div>\n        <span class=\"choice-mark\">（　）</span>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$2$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$1$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$-1$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$-2$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"stem\">7．已知$\\sin\\alpha-3\\cos\\alpha=0$，则$\\dfrac{3\\cos\\alpha-4\\sin\\alpha}{\\sin\\alpha+\\cos\\alpha}=$</div>\n        <div class=\"choices\">\n          <div class=\"choice\">A．$-\\dfrac{9}{4}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">B．$\\dfrac{4}{9}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">C．$\\dfrac{3}{4}$</div>\n          <div class=\"choice\">D．$-3$</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
